id=wifi7_lab_safe
name=WiFi 7 Capability Keeper
version=v1.4.1
versionCode=141
author=E3N
description=Feature-probes actual EHT/MLO vendor switches and keeps supported 6GHz capabilities available, applies a standards-compliant Android Wi-Fi country profile with framework+driver readback, and exports detailed Wi-Fi 7 diagnostics for pudding/peach_v2. Does not patch regdb, bypass DFS/AFC, or force out-of-domain TX power.
